{"strongs": "H0645", "word": "אֵפוֺ", "translit": "e.pho", "root": "אפד", "morph": "H:Part", "pos": "enclitic particle", "gloss": "then", "definition": "אֵפוֺ ( Job 17:15 ; Job 19:6 ; Job 19:23 ; Job 24:25 ), elsewhere אֵפוֺא (compare רִבּוֺ and רִבּוֺא ), enclitic particle then (probably from פּוֺ , a particle with a demonstrative force, compare פּוֺ , פֹּה here, with א prefixed. In the Targs. פּוֺן is used somewhat similarly, e.g. Gen 26:10 ; Num 11:29 ; Isa 1:9 ; Isa 48:18 ; Isa 48:19 ), — used 1. in connection with interrogatory pronouns or adverbs (like ἄρα , ποτε tandem): מִי אֵפוֺא Gen 27:3 who, then , . . . ? v Gen 27:37 וּלְכָה אֵפוֺא מָה אֶעֱשֶׂה and for thee, then , what shall I do, my son ? Exod 33:16 וּבַמֶּה יִוָּדַע אֵפוֺא and wherein shall it be known, then ...? אַיה אֵפוֺא where, then ? Judg 9:38 ; Isa 19:12 ; Job 17:15 ; Hos 13:10 אֱהִי מַלְכְךָ אֵפוֺא Isa 22:1 מַהלָּֿח אֵפוֺא what is there to thee, pray . . .? 2. in a command or wish : 2Kgs 10:10 דְּעוּ אֵפוֺא ? know, then ; (in apodosis) Prov 6:3 ; Job 19:6 ; Job 19:23 מִיּיִֿתֵּן אֵפוֺ וְיִכָּֽתְבוּן מִלָּי֑ would, then , that my words were written ! 3. after אִם Gen 43:11 אִםכֵּֿן אֵפוֺא זאֹת עֲשׂו if it be so, then , do this, Job 9:24 if not then , who is it ? Job 24:25 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB659')\">BDB659</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H645')\">H645</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB658')\">BDB658</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB660')\">BDB660</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֵפוֺ</bdbheb> (<ref ref=\"Job 17:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,17,15)\">Job 17:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 19:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,6)\">Job 19:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 19:23\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,23)\">Job 19:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 24:25\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(18,24,25)\">Job 24:25</ref>), elsewhere <bdbheb>אֵפוֺא</bdbheb> (compare <bdbheb>רִבּוֺ</bdbheb> and <bdbheb>רִבּוֺא</bdbheb> ), <b>enclitic particle</b> <highlightword>then</highlightword> (probably from <bdbheb>פּוֺ</bdbheb>, a particle with a demonstrative force, compare <bdbheb>פּוֺ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>פֹּה</bdbheb> here, with <bdbheb>א</bdbheb> prefixed. In the Targs. <bdbheb>פּוֺן</bdbheb> is used somewhat similarly, e.g. <ref ref=\"Gen 26:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,26,10)\">Gen 26:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 11:29\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,29)\">Num 11:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 1:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,9)\">Isa 1:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 48:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,48,18)\">Isa 48:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 48:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,48,19)\">Isa 48:19</ref>), — used <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> in connection with interrogatory pronouns or adverbs (like <grk>ἄρα</grk>, <grk>ποτε</grk> tandem): <bdbheb>מִי אֵפוֺא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 27:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,3)\">Gen 27:3</ref> who, <highlight>then</highlight>, . . . ? v<ref ref=\"Gen 27:37\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,37)\">Gen 27:37</ref> <bdbheb>וּלְכָה אֵפוֺא מָה אֶעֱשֶׂה</bdbheb> and for thee, <highlight>then</highlight>, what shall I do, my son ? <ref ref=\"Exod 33:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,33,16)\">Exod 33:16</ref> <bdbheb>וּבַמֶּה יִוָּדַע אֵפוֺא</bdbheb> and wherein shall it be known, <highlight>then</highlight>...? <bdbheb>אַיה אֵפוֺא</bdbheb> where, then ? <ref ref=\"Judg 9:38\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,38)\">Judg 9:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 19:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,19,12)\">Isa 19:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 17:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,17,15)\">Job 17:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 13:10\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(28,13,10)\">Hos 13:10</ref> <bdbheb>אֱהִי מַלְכְךָ אֵפוֺא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 22:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,22,1)\">Isa 22:1</ref> <bdbheb>מַהלָּֿח אֵפוֺא</bdbheb> what is there to thee, <highlight>pray</highlight>. . .? </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> in a command or wish : <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,10)\">2Kgs 10:10</ref> <bdbheb>דְּעוּ אֵפוֺא</bdbheb> ? know, <highlight>then</highlight>; (in apodosis) <ref ref=\"Prov 6:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,3)\">Prov 6:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 19:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,6)\">Job 19:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 19:23\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,23)\">Job 19:23</ref> <bdbheb>מִיּיִֿתֵּן אֵפוֺ וְיִכָּֽתְבוּן מִלָּי֑</bdbheb> would, <highlight>then</highlight>, that my words were written ! </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> after <bdbheb>אִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 43:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,43,11)\">Gen 43:11</ref> <bdbheb>אִםכֵּֿן אֵפוֺא זאֹת עֲשׂו</bdbheb> if it be so, <highlight>then</highlight>, do this, <ref ref=\"Job 9:24\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(18,9,24)\">Job 9:24</ref> if not <highlight>then</highlight>, who is it ? <ref ref=\"Job 24:25\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(18,24,25)\">Job 24:25</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Job 17:15", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 17, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Job 19:6", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 19, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Job 19:23", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 19, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Job 24:25", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 24, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Gen 26:10", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 26, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Num 11:29", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 11, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "Isa 1:9", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 1, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Isa 48:18", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 48, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Isa 48:19", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 48, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Gen 27:3", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 27, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Gen 27:37", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 27, "verse": 37}, {"raw": "Exod 33:16", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 33, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Judg 9:38", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 9, "verse": 38}, {"raw": "Isa 19:12", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 19, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Hos 13:10", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 13, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Isa 22:1", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 22, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "2Kgs 10:10", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 10, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Prov 6:3", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 6, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Gen 43:11", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 43, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Job 9:24", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 9, "verse": 24}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["אֵפוֺ", "אֵפוֺא", "רִבּוֺ", "רִבּוֺא", "פּוֺ", "פֹּה", "א", "פּוֺן", "מִי אֵפוֺא", "וּלְכָה אֵפוֺא מָה אֶעֱשֶׂה", "וּבַמֶּה יִוָּדַע אֵפוֺא", "אַיה אֵפוֺא", "אֱהִי מַלְכְךָ אֵפוֺא", "מַהלָּֿח אֵפוֺא", "דְּעוּ אֵפוֺא", "מִיּיִֿתֵּן אֵפוֺ וְיִכָּֽתְבוּן מִלָּי֑", "אִם", "אִםכֵּֿן אֵפוֺא זאֹת עֲשׂו"], "aramaic": [], "greek": ["ἄρα", "ποτε"], "translit": [], "abbreviations": []}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB659", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}